      "name": "core.openwop.workflows.lighthouse",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "Real-work workflow pack (RFC 0013 follow-on). The five zero-config 'lighthouse' workflows from the catalog — Lead Triage, Account Brief, Renewal & Churn-Risk Digest, RFP Response, and Post-Meeting Follow-up — authored entirely over node typeIds shipped with this host (feature.crm/kb/analytics + core.ai.chatCompletion + core.chat.approvalGate + core.openwop.integration.*). Each rides real tenant data through the feature node packs, reasons with the LLM node, gates every external send behind a human approval, and delivers a usable artifact. Tenant-specific values are RUN PARAMETERS (never hardcoded) so the expansion stays replay-deterministic. Picking one in the builder instantiates a fully-editable, runnable, assignable workflow.",
